  "uprn": null,
  "decision_date": "02/07/2002",
  "description": "Construction  of a basement floor to provide ancillary storage area in connection with proposed four storey building to provide restaurant and six 2-bedroomed flats.",
  "site_name": "187-189",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "05/06/2002",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": null,
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major general industry-storage-warehousing",
  "lapsed_date": "01/07/2007",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development shall be implemented no later than 13th October 2002.",
    "Condition : 2 - The basement shall be used for ancillary purposes to the restaurant only and shall not be used for public seating accommodation or for access by the public except for ancillary toilet accommodation.",
    "Condition : 3 - In the event of toilets being installed, these shall be made accessible for people with disabilities in accordance with a scheme to be submitted and approved by the Local Planning Authority before the relevant part of the work is cxommenced.",
    "Condition : 4 - No development shall take place until samples of the materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted have been submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority.  Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details",
    "Condition : 5 - The access doorway to the entrance shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle not more than 1m above ground level.",
    "Condition : 6 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the use hereby commences, a scheme for protecting the residential units from noise from the restaurant and from Chiswick High Road shall be submitted to, and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - Before the use hereby permitted commences, a scheme shall be submitted to, and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority, for the effective control of fumes and odours from the premises. The scheme shall be implemented before the use commences or within such extended period as may be agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 9 - The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times: 9.00 a.m to 11.30pm.",
    "Condition : 10 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8.00 a.m to 6.00 p.m. on Mondays to Friday and 9.00 a.m. to 12.30 p.m.          on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and public holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority."
  ],
